---

<Layout title="Tentang Kami - ConsultIT">
  <main class="flex-1">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center py-24 sm:py-32 md:py-40">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 max-w-4xl">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-subtext-light dark:text-subtext-dark">Tentang Kami</p>
          <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tighter">
            Mendorong Inovasi, Memberdayakan Masa Depan
          </h1>
          <h2 class="text-subtext-light dark:text-subtext-dark text-lg font-normal leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto">
            Kami adalah tim ahli teknologi yang bersemangat dalam memecahkan masalah kompleks dan
            menciptakan solusi yang berdampak bagi klien kami di seluruh dunia.
          </h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="py-16 md:py-24">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <div
            class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border border-border-light dark:border-border-dark bg-background-light dark:bg-card-dark p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">visibility</span>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
              <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold leading-tight">Visi Kami</h2>
              <p class="text-subtext-light dark:text-subtext-dark text-base font-normal leading-relaxed">
                Menjadi mitra teknologi terdepan yang mendorong inovasi dan pertumbuhan berkelanjutan
                bagi klien kami di seluruh dunia.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border border-border-light dark:border-border-dark bg-background-light dark:bg-card-dark p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">rocket_launch</span>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
              <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold leading-tight">Misi Kami</h2>
              <p class="text-subtext-light dark:text-subtext-dark text-base font-normal leading-relaxed">
                Memberikan solusi IT yang disesuaikan, andal, dan canggih melalui keahlian mendalam
                dan layanan konsultasi yang luar biasa.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border border-border-light dark:border-border-dark bg-background-light dark:bg-card-dark p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">handshake</span>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
              <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold leading-tight">Nilai-Nilai Kami</h2>
              <p class="text-subtext-light dark:text-subtext-dark text-base font-normal leading-relaxed">
                Integritas, Kolaborasi, Keunggulan, dan Inovasi adalah pilar utama yang menopang
                budaya kerja dan hubungan kami dengan klien.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="py-16 md:py-24">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:gap-16 items-center">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tighter">
              Perjalanan Kami Sejauh Ini
            </h2>
            <p class="text-subtext-light dark:text-subtext-dark text-lg leading-relaxed">
              Dari ide sederhana hingga menjadi mitra teknologi terpercaya, setiap langkah dalam
              sejarah kami didorong oleh semangat inovasi dan komitmen terhadap kesuksesan klien.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full">
            <div class="border-l border-border-light dark:border-border-dark pl-8 space-y-10">
              <div class="relative">
                <div
                  class="absolute -left-[33px] top-1.5 flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark"
                >
                  <div class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-text-light dark:bg-text-dark"></div>
                </div>
                <p class="text-lg font-semibold">Pendirian Perusahaan</p>
                <p class="text-base text-subtext-light dark:text-subtext-dark">2018</p>
              </div>
              <div class="relative">
                <div
                  class="absolute -left-[33px] top-1.5 flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark"
                >
                  <div class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-text-light dark:bg-text-dark"></div>
                </div>
                <p class="text-lg font-semibold">Proyek Besar Pertama</p>
                <p class="text-base text-subtext-light dark:text-subtext-dark">2019</p>
              </div>
              <div class="relative">
                <div
                  class="absolute -left-[33px] top-1.5 flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark"
                >
                  <div class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-text-light dark:bg-text-dark"></div>
                </div>
                <p class="text-lg font-semibold">Ekspansi Tim</p>
                <p class="text-base text-subtext-light dark:text-subtext-dark">2021</p>
              </div>
              <div class="relative">
                <div
                  class="absolute -left-[33px] top-1.5 flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark"
                >
                  <div class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-text-light dark:bg-text-dark"></div>
                </div>
                <p class="text-lg font-semibold">Penghargaan Industri</p>
                <p class="text-base text-subtext-light dark:text-subtext-dark">2023</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="py-16 md:py-24">
        <div
          class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-px bg-border-light dark:bg-border-dark border border-border-light dark:border-border-dark rounded-xl overflow-hidden"
        >
          <div
            class="flex flex-col gap-2 p-8 bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark text-center items-center"
          >
            <p class="text-subtext-light dark:text-subtext-dark text-base font-medium leading-normal">
              Proyek Selesai
            </p>
            <p class="tracking-tighter text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight">150+</p>
          </div>
          <div
            class="flex flex-col gap-2 p-8 bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark text-center items-center"
          >
            <p class="text-subtext-light dark:text-subtext-dark text-base font-medium leading-normal">
              Klien Puas
            </p>
            <p class="tracking-tighter text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight">98%</p>
          </div>
          <div
            class="flex flex-col gap-2 p-8 bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark text-center items-center"
          >
            <p class="text-subtext-light dark:text-subtext-dark text-base font-medium leading-normal">
              Tahun Pengalaman
            </p>
            <p class="tracking-tighter text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight">5+</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-10 py-16 md:py-24">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-center items-center">
          <h2 class="tracking-tighter text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight md:text-4xl max-w-2xl">
            Perkenalkan Tim Kami
          </h2>
          <p class="text-subtext-light dark:text-subtext-dark text-lg font-normal leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
            Kami adalah sekelompok ahli strategi, desainer, dan developer yang bersemangat dalam
            membangun solusi digital yang luar biasa.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-x-6 gap-y-10">
          {
            team.map((member) => (
              <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center group">
                <div class="relative w-40 h-40">
                  <img
                    class="rounded-full object-cover w-full h-full grayscale transition-all duration-300 group-hover:grayscale-0"
                    alt={`Professional headshot of ${member.name}`}
                    src={member.image}
                  />
                </div>
                <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col items-center">
                  <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">{member.name}</h3>
                  <p class="text-subtext-light dark:text-subtext-dark text-sm font-medium">
                    {member.role}
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-background-dark dark:bg-card-dark rounded-xl p-10 md:p-16 my-16 md:my-24">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 items-center text-center">
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold text-text-dark max-w-2xl tracking-tighter">
            Siap Membangun Masa Depan?
          </h2>
          <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-text-muted-dark max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
            Mari wujudkan ide Anda menjadi solusi digital yang nyata. Hubungi kami untuk konsultasi
            gratis dan temukan bagaimana kami dapat membantu bisnis Anda berkembang.
          </p>
          <button
            class="flex min-w-[84px] max-w-[480px] cursor-pointer items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full h-11 px-6 bg-white text-black text-sm font-medium leading-normal hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-colors"
          >
            <span class="truncate">Hubungi Kami</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
